ecause the former succeeds  in holding him off for a while  eventually mihawk says they should  settle this later and vista agrees  saying it seems that would benefit both  of them later when luffy and ivankov try  to reach ace mihawk again goes after  luffy das bones blocks the attack under  crocodile's orders however to mihawk's  credit he does cut down daw's bones  immediately then crocodile intercepts  his future business partner and that  again gives luffy a chance to escape  notably there does seem to be respect  between these two since mihawk as with  vista uses crocodile's name so it's  clear that luffy could only escape  mihawk because of all the people that  interfered even though we wouldn't  consider these characters anywhere near  shanks's level they do succeed in  holding mihawk back from luffy and again  to hype up crocodile he tells mihawk  he's not in a good mood right now so  hawkeye had better watch out first his  comments are doflamingo and now this  crocodile is definitely talking big and  some people mentioned that crocodile  doesn't have haki because it hasn't been  focused on even armament haki since we  didn't see him use it per se but that's  hard to believe although haki hadn't  really been developed in the story at  this point in order to counter mihawk's  black blade i feel like crocodile would  have had to had at least armament haki  but to be fair it hasn't been confirmed  i just feel like someone as strong as  crocodile has to have it then of course  we have the famous moment where shanks  and his crew stop the war and mihawk's  response to shanks's arrival was that he  never agreed to fight shanks and he  stopped fighting right there on the spot  now to be fair mihawk wasn't sweating or  beaten up or anything at this point so  it's easy to say he didn't give it his  all or had more to give etc but one  can't deny that when shanks showed up no  one would accept his challenge and  multiple sub yonko characters like vista  and crocodile